  "prefLabel": "Lot 8009.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 8009.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish a uniform classification guideline for the use of foreign substances in horse racing and to establish penalties for certain prohibited practices and the use of prohibited substances.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Lot 8000) #12544, eff 6-1-18",
